{"id":77993,"slug":"bukan-rky-2023","title":"Bukanýrky","title_en":"The Buccaneers","year":2023,"rating":62,"votes_count":142,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"seriál","vod_date":null,"plot":"Skupina rozpustilých mladých Američanek vtrhne na scénu korzety sešněrovaného Londýna 70. let 19. století a vyprovokuje střet obou kultur. Dívky si zde mají najít manžely a zajistit své společenské postavení, avšak jejich srdce se upínají na mnohem více.(Apple TV+)","poster":"https://image.pmgstatic.com/cache/resized/w140/files/images/film/posters/170/628/170628575_32tr8o.png","backdrop":null,"trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Drama"],"tags":["podle knihy"],"countries":["Velká Británie"],"directors":["Richard Senior","Susanna White","Charlotte Regan","William McGregor","Charlie Manton","Rachel Leiterman","John Hardwick"],"actors":["Kristine Froseth","Alisha Boe","Josie Totah","Aubri Ibrag","Imogen Waterhouse","Mia Threapleton","Christina Hendricks","Simone Kirby","Josh Dylan","Amelia Bullmore","Anthony Calf","Adam James","Fenella Woolgar","Geff Francis","Francesca Corney","Elizabeth Millbank","Marcus Macleod","Angela Sant'Albano","Seylan Baxter","Matthew Broome","Leighton Meester","Grace Ambrose","John Arnold","Guy Remmers","Barney Fishwick","Shobhit Piasa","Jacob Ifan","Maria Almeida","Amanda Bright","Greg Wise","Antonio Scarpa","Beth Chalmers","Joseph Mydell","Simon Manyonda","Corey Johnson","Anthony Welsh","Luke Cinque-White"],"screenwriters":["Katherine Jakeways","Roanne Bardsley","Catherine Shepherd","Emma Jane Unsworth","Anna-Maria Ssemuyaba","Alex Straker","Dana Fainaru","Ava Pickett"],"cinematographers":["Oliver Curtis","Matthew Wicks","Laura Bellingham","Simona Susnea","Marvin V. Rush","Neville Kidd"],"composers":["Aisling Brouwer","Anna Phoebe"],"reviews":[{"author":"M.i.k.e","text":"Když pominu, že je celkem úsměvné jak se tahle série snaží vnutit myšlenku, že v oné době musely dorazit rozjařené američanky aby prkeným angličanům ukázaly zač je toho